  "Overview": "Leela is a ground-breaking journey of mind and body.\n\nDeepak Chopra's Leela combines traditional relaxation and meditation with Wii motion technology to instill a sense of balance and harmony to every day life.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Rebalance and Revitalize. Flow with your natural rhythms and full-body gestures to unwind and relax\n• Ambient Oasis. Immerse yourself in Leela's restorative environments filled with rich visuals and healing sound\n• Personal Creativity. Create a personal mandala - an artistic expression of your essence",
